{"id":"658bea3e76b250ff","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate (Bew)","display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate (Bew)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["57-df-provability-predicate","57-df-bew"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate (Bew)","depends_on":["[[57-df-arity]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-provable]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-natural-number]]","[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[57-df-numeral]]","[[57-df-free-for]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-provability-predicate</span><span>57-df-bew</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate (Bew)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" href=\"?note=973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" title=\"57-df-provable\">57-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5a8141676f191f64\" href=\"?note=5a8141676f191f64\" title=\"57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8216e0b1a4cf9570\" href=\"?note=8216e0b1a4cf9570\" title=\"57-df-free-for\">57-df-free-for</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 的有效可数语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a> 的标准一阶关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a> 的标准算术结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> 在本文件专指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"5a8141676f191f64\" href=\"?note=5a8141676f191f64\" title=\"57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a> 的语法公式集合。固定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\)</span> 时，必须同时给出一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_T\\in\\mathcal B(T,g,x)\">\\(B_T\\in\\mathcal B(T,g,x)\\)</span>，该候选族由下式定义。不同合法选择不被视为字面相同的公式。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>谓词记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,B_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,B_T)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"8216e0b1a4cf9570\" href=\"?note=8216e0b1a4cf9570\" title=\"57-df-free-for\">57-df-free-for</a>，参数依次为项、变量和公式，作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(t)\\)</span> 的自由可代入侧条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(T,g,x)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{B\\in\\Sigma_1^0:\\mathrm{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models B[\\underline{g(\\varphi)}/x]\\bigr)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B(T,g,x)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{B\\in\\Sigma_1^0:\\mathrm{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models B[\\underline{g(\\varphi)}/x]\\bigr)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\coloneqq B_T,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Bew}_T(t)\\coloneqq B_T[t/x]\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,B_T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\coloneqq B_T,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Bew}_T(t)\\coloneqq B_T[t/x]\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,B_T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x))\\subseteq\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x))\\subseteq\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\quad\nT\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\quad\nT\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文仅规定候选公式应满足的外延性质，并未指定唯一公式。这里显式保留该“选定候选公式”的参数化接口，不把任意算术理论都断言为存在候选公式，也不从外延正确性推出 Hilbert–Bernays 条件。后者必须另外检验或假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[