 [[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]] 的语法公式集合。固定变量 $x$；使用 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T$ 时，必须同时给出一个 $B_T\\in\\mathcal B(T,g,x)$，该候选族由下式定义。不同合法选择不被视为字面相同的公式。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-for","status":"resolved","id":"8216e0b1a4cf9570","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"谓词记号 $\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,B_T)$ 取 [[57-df-free-for]]，参数依次为项、变量和公式，作为 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T(t)$ 的自由可代入侧条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^0","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_T","display":false},{"tex":"B_T\\in\\mathcal B(T,g,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,B_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(T,g,x)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{B\\in\\Sigma_1^0:\\mathrm{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models B[\\underline{g(\\varphi)}/x]\\bigr)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\coloneqq B_T,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Bew}_T(t)\\coloneqq B_T[t/x]\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,B_T)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x))\\subseteq\\{x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\quad\nT\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)}).","display":true}],"bytes":2241,"backlinks":[{"id":"26ff54205c748daa","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$L\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$；$g$ 和固定选定的一元公式 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)$ 取 [[57-df-provability-predicate]] 的同一实例。$\\